## 🎨 Vibe Coding Workflow

### Phase 1: Planning
```
1. Read DEVELOPMENT_PLAN.md for project context
   ↓
2. Identify the task/feature to implement
   ↓
3. Review AGENTS.md for coding standards
   ↓
4. Plan changes (files, roles, variables)
```

### Phase 2: AI-Assisted Development
```
1. Use AI to generate boilerplate code
   ↓
2. Review and understand generated code
   ↓
3. Refine with AI based on project standards
   ↓
4. Add error handling and edge cases
```

### Phase 3: Quality Assurance
```
1. Run syntax check: ansible-playbook --syntax-check
   ↓
2. Run linting: ansible-lint
   ↓
3. Test idempotency (run twice, check no changes)
   ↓
4. Update documentation
```

### Phase 4: Commit & Review
```
1. Pre-commit hooks run automatically
   ↓
2. Fix any issues found
   ↓
3. Commit with conventional message
   ↓
4. Create pull request for review
```

