## 🚨 Common Pitfalls & Solutions

### Pitfall 1: Blindly Accepting AI Suggestions
**Problem:** AI generates non-idempotent code  
**Solution:** Always verify idempotency by running twice  
**Prevention:** Include idempotency requirement in prompts

### Pitfall 2: Insufficient Context
**Problem:** AI generates code that doesn't fit project  
**Solution:** Reference AGENTS.md and existing patterns  
**Prevention:** Open related files before asking AI

### Pitfall 3: Security Oversights
**Problem:** AI includes hardcoded secrets  
**Solution:** Use Ansible Vault variables  
**Prevention:** Emphasize security in prompts

### Pitfall 4: Poor Documentation
**Problem:** AI-generated code lacks comments  
**Solution:** Ask AI to add comprehensive documentation  
**Prevention:** Include documentation requirement in prompts

